{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1166870-dtf-what-happens-to-a-fallens-thralls-if-the-fallen-falls-back-into-the-abyss","id":1166870,"title":"DTF: What happens to a Fallens Thralls if the Fallen falls back into the Abyss","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-11T18:27:50-08:00","id":1166870,"title":"DTF: What happens to a Fallens Thralls if the Fallen falls back into the Abyss","content":"What happens to the Pacts a Demon has made when he falls back into the Abyss?<br /> Does this end the Pacts?<br /> Can the Fallen receive Faith from there Thralls in the Abyss?<br /> Can the Fallen continue to empower his Thralls while in the Abyss?<br /> <br /> Answers with Book Titles and Page numbers will be greatly appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11219-vikingsean711","name":"Vikingsean711","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T19:33:53-08:00","id":1166888,"title":"","content":"I'd say as long as the demon exists then the pacts remain, the demon just doesn't get any benefit as long as they are in the abyss, I might give optional rules that every so many thralls you have reduce the difficulty of a summoning roll to bring the demon back from the abyss","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-11T22:32:25-08:00","id":1166916,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1166870-dtf-what-happens-to-a-fallens-thralls-if-the-fallen-falls-back-into-the-abyss?p=1166888#post1166888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd say as long as the demon exists then the pacts remain, the demon just doesn't get any benefit as long as they are in the abyss, I might give optional rules that every so many thralls you have reduce the difficulty of a summoning roll to bring the demon back from the abyss</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Ok but if he cant gain any of the benifits and therefore does not get the faith how does he empower his thralls?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11219-vikingsean711","name":"Vikingsean711","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T16:03:50-08:00","id":1167174,"title":"","content":"It isn't so much that the Fallen doesn't get faith, but more that it isn't relevant in the Abyss.<br /> <br /> There is simply no change in the status of a Thrall when the Demon is banished. The creature can't do much anymore, but the link isn't really affected. The changes bestowed over the mortal, in particular, are linked to the power of the mortal's very Faith, the Demon just gave shape to it.<br /> <br /> By the way, Thralls are the most likely to be taught a summoning ritual specific for their master, just in such a case. Returning to the Abyss isn't the end for the Fallen, instead it is quite expected to happens now and then, so the game won't make it such a big deal on the long run (though it can still be very dramatic, depending on the relationships the character developed in that incarnation).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T16:59:30-08:00","id":1167184,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vikingsean711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1166870-dtf-what-happens-to-a-fallens-thralls-if-the-fallen-falls-back-into-the-abyss?p=1166916#post1166916\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Ok but if he cant gain any of the benifits and therefore does not get the faith how does he empower his thralls?</div> </div> </div> </div>Some of the thrall's faith potential is converted into the pact benefit","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T01:30:13-08:00","id":1167245,"title":"","content":"OK but doesnt a demon have to continually empower the thrall. The way i understand it is if a Fallen gets 2 faith from a thrall every sunrise the fallen gets one of those points and the other one is used keep the Thrall empowered. How does the Fallen keep the Thrall empowered while in the Abyss? I swear im not trying to be difficult here i just want to cover all my bases. I would like to find some kind of official rulling on this in one of the books but i cant seem to find an official answer one way or the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11219-vikingsean711","name":"Vikingsean711","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-13T01:50:05-08:00","id":1167250,"title":"","content":"Because the fallen isn't the one empowering the thrall. It's just the one that built the mechanism to empower the thrall.<br /> <br /> Look at it this way. The thrall's faith is a small reactor that is normally dormant. Once the demon shows up and finds a way to start it up and pump some juice out of it, that reactor keeps pumping energy out as long as the thrall keeps his side of the pact.<br /> <br /> The demon takes some of the reactors energy and creates a mechanism to divert the other energy back into the thrall to power it's gifts. The energy comes from the thrall, the demon just had to build the turbine to harness it. Even if the demon isn't present as long as the thrall keeps the faith moving the turbine keeps turning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5617-vendrin","name":"Vendrin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5617_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-15T04:25:44-08:00","id":1167864,"title":"","content":"Thank you this has been most helpful","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11219-vikingsean711","name":"Vikingsean711","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-15T14:40:44-08:00","id":1168025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vikingsean711</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1166870-dtf-what-happens-to-a-fallens-thralls-if-the-fallen-falls-back-into-the-abyss?p=1167245#post1167245\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">OK but doesnt a demon have to continually empower the thrall. The way i understand it is if a Fallen gets 2 faith from a thrall every sunrise the fallen gets one of those points and the other one is used keep the Thrall empowered. How does the Fallen keep the Thrall empowered while in the Abyss? I swear im not trying to be difficult here i just want to cover all my bases. I would like to find some kind of official rulling on this in one of the books but i cant seem to find an official answer one way or the other.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. It is the other way around.<br /> <br /> The power of the Pact comes from the Thrall. The Fallen, as a creative entity, have the means to &quot;shape&quot; Faith into other things. Also, as an entity of faith, it is empowered by the belief this Thrall deposits in it.<br /> <br /> Faith is something Demons can work on several ways because they know how to, but they can't produce or directly control. The Demon get to take decisions in the final effect because it haves the technical knowledge of what's going on, like a programmer or a sculptor. The mortal have the true power at work, that is Faith, and that is the catch, the mortal's Faith is what is doing all the work here, all of it. This Faith have to be directed, and this is where the Pact itself enters. The first thing a Pact ever needs is that the mortal truly believe in the Demon, that is, the mortal have to deposit his Faith in the Fallen prior to the Pact, and then it defines boundaries for the Demon to work, it canalizes the energy to the Demon and make the mortal suitable for being shaped <i>by its own Faith</i>.<br /> <br /> Observe how the Pact just goes outside of the usual purview of a Demon. The Fallen cannot use any energy on it that isn't already on the mortal, the power level of the specific Fallen isn't a factor on the result, and only the most exotic transformations even require any specific ability from the Fallen, so the things bestowed upon the Thrall can be previously absent from both entities. The Demon do not empower the Pact more than an electrical engineer empowers a wired generator.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}